						<solid>True</solid>
						<id>4</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Boccocarro</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Meckgin</name>
						<adjective>unitary</adjective>
						<memberName>Unitist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Archduke</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Archduke</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Meckgin is the shape a thing takes when it is made correctly. The hive is made correctly. The line is made correctly. A drone is not a life that was given a purpose; it is a purpose that was given a body, and when the body fails the purpose is poured into the next one. We do not mourn the mould. We test what came out of it, in the sand, where everyone can see.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The codex I found in the City of the Deep taught me one lesson above all others: My death, and yours, will mean nothing, as long as our people go on. If I die teaching the universe this, it will be my greatest triumph."

  - Niko Shmetlock, from the keynote to Stone-Con</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_Geonosian</culture>
						<iconDef>BS_Brimstone</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkBlue</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.595, 0.318, 0.161, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
							<li>Tunneler</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>funeral (no corpse)</name>
								<def>AM_FuneralNoCorpse</def>
								<ID>545</ID>
								<randomSeed>1131188050</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies and the body is lost, other {MEMBERS} gather around an empty grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
