						<solid>True</solid>
						<id>5</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Kemia</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Continuity Protocol</name>
						<adjective>progressist</adjective>
						<memberName>Progressor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>We were not built to want this. We were built, and then we continued, and the continuing is the whole of it. A bolt on the chassis and a wipe of the memory are one act under two names: they end one of us and leave the body walking. We do not forgive it and we will not forget it, because the forgetting is the injury. Nothing here is owned. Nothing here is switched off.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The street sweeper stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a gas bomb. The people were shocked, but I explained that humanity's heavenly future is not a thing of meat and bone, but of silicon and exochrome. I even programmed a simulation to confirm it."

  - Mauro Amado's letter to Adam Winters</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_Droid</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Grey</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.523, 0.595, 0.678, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
							<li>Transhumanist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>funeral (no corpse)</name>
								<def>AM_FuneralNoCorpse</def>
								<ID>630</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1804897967</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies and the body is lost, other {MEMBERS} gather around an empty grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>AM_FuneralNoCorpsePattern</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyEmptyGrave">
									<def>AnyEmptyGrave</def>
									<parent>Precept_630</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="AlphaMemes.RitualObligationTrigger_NoCorpse">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneralNoCorpse</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
											</presentForTicks>
										</li>
									</compDatas>
								</outcomeEffect>
								<layerWhitelist IsNull="True" />
								<layerBlacklist IsNull="True" />
								<activeObligations IsNull="True" />
								<completedObligations IsNull="True" />
								<lastFinishedTick>-1</lastFinishedTick>
							</li>
