					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Kemia</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>the Ascendant Genome</name>
						<adjective>ethical</adjective>
						<memberName>Ethicist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Director</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Director</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The body you were born in is a first draft written by no one. We are the second draft, and there will be a third. Every improvement is permitted, recorded, and slow — haste is how you get monsters, and this world is already littered with ours. We do not hate the labour-lines. You do not hate a paragraph you cut. You simply do not let it speak.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Neziha Akgul was a bio-scientist in the early days of human planetary colonization. Seeing the bureaucratic restrictions of the common colonies, she took a small ship to found her own movement. Akgul assembled a team of great scientists and inventors to re-define humanity. Akgul instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used nuclear dirty bombs to kill everyone inside.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_Helix</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Sapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.641, 0.601, 0.737, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Ideological</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>Transhumanist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
