						<solid>True</solid>
						<id>7</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Rogia</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>the Withdrawn</name>
									<type>That Which Was Given</type>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>the Covenant of Free Wells</name>
						<adjective>guiltist</adjective>
						<memberName>Guilty One</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Marshal</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Marshal</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Water was given once and the Giver stepped back, and we have not been spoken to since. That is not abandonment. It is the test. A well belongs to whoever is thirsty standing at it — we have never turned a stranger away, and we have buried our own for it. We do not take up arms and go out. We stand on our own ground, we keep the vaporators turning, and we answer to the silence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The early porpoise ranchers of the glitter-tech world Rogia built a great %%altar0_name%% to %%deity0_name%%. A rival group polluted the sacred waters of the %%memberNamePlural%%, prompting outrage and calls for action. An artisan farmer named Kelly 'Aprillic' Venus was blessed by %%deity0_name%% and gained miraculous knowledge of the unique power of each and every %%memberName%%. She said to each one what they needed to become their best self. To atone for half their wrongs, Aprillic gathered half of %%deity0_name%%'s believers to herself in a robotics factory, unleashed an archotech mass-inverter, and died with them. The second half of atonement continues.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_Homestead</culture>
						<iconDef>AnimalsD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightMauve</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.426, 0.376, 0.828, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>Guilty</li>
							<li>Individualist</li>
							<li>Rancher</li>
							<li>AM_WaterPrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>ranching</name>
								<def>Ranching_Central</def>
								<ID>801</ID>
								<randomSeed>-163028738</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>funeral (no corpse)</name>
								<def>AM_FuneralNoCorpse</def>
								<ID>805</ID>
								<randomSeed>-1906468425</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies and the body is lost, other {MEMBERS} gather around an empty grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>AM_FuneralNoCorpsePattern</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyEmptyGrave">
									<def>AnyEmptyGrave</def>
									<parent>Precept_805</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
