						<memberName>Axebearer</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Timber Overseer</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Timber Overseer</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The perfection of flameless combustion on the 22nd century was revolutionary. Society was shook to its core, and great philosophers arose that taught us that only by cutting down the old can we build the future. Let this axiom echo in your mind as the sound of the axe echoes in the glade."

  - Maxim Barrera's studies on the Brass Chronicles</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The perfection of flameless combustion on the 22nd century was revolutionary. Society was shook to its core, and great philosophers arose that taught us that only by cutting down the old can we build the future. Let this axiom echo in your mind as the sound of the axe echoes in the glade."

  - Maxim Barrera's studies on the Brass Chronicles</descriptionTemplate>
