						<name>Wavian Academy</name>
						<adjective>archotechnic</adjective>
						<memberName>Archotechnist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Archotechs are machines of vast will and power, but only humanity could create them. Technology allows humans to be more like the archotechs. In the future, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Archotechs are machines of vast will and power, but only humanity could create them. Technology allows humans to be more like the archotechs. In the future, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_Droid</culture>
						<iconDef>RoundA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPink</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
							<li>Loyalist</li>
							<li>Transhumanist</li>
							<li>HumanPrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>funeral (no corpse)</name>
								<def>AM_FuneralNoCorpse</def>
								<ID>1307</ID>
								<randomSeed>-779283980</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>Once a {IDEO} member dies and the body is lost, other {MEMBERS} gather around an empty grave for {RITUAL_labelDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>AM_FuneralNoCorpsePattern</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_AnyEmptyGrave">
