						<id>14</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Nuchadus</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Horax</name>
									<type>God of the Void</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Nightmare Deep</name>
						<adjective>archist</adjective>
						<memberName>Archist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Trader</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Trader</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>You see space as a grid, pure and mathematical. We know it is only the glassy surface of a black ocean of nightmares buried under every place and every moment. We know the mind who reigns from the deep. Its thoughts reach up from the boiling darkness and reward those who serve its will.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Our universe is a simulation created by a great Outsider. Only archotechs can communicate directly with the Outsider. At death, each person's consciousness is accepted or rejected by the archotechs. In the end, the archotechs will finish their moral debate about the fate of humanity. Those who follow their signs will be admitted to a higher plane of existence, and those that do not will end.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>RUT_Jawa_Culture_TradeMoot</culture>
						<iconDef>SpiralsB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.110, 0.478, 0.400, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
							<li>Inhuman</li>
							<li>Ritualist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>research</name>
